---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, PHONE, PHONE_TEL } from '../../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<BaseHead title={`Drain Cleaning | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Professional drain and sewer cleaning in Yucaipa, CA. Clear clogs and restore proper flow without harsh chemicals." />
</head>
<body>
	<Header />

	<section class="page-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Drain Cleaning</h1>
			<p>Fast, thorough clearing of clogged drains and sewer lines in Yucaipa.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="content">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="content-grid">
				<div>
					<h2>Drains We Clear</h2>
					<p>Slow or stopped drains are one of the most common plumbing calls. We clear clogs safely and effectively.</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Kitchen sink and disposal drains</li>
						<li>Bathroom sinks, tubs, and showers</li>
						<li>Toilet clogs</li>
						<li>Main sewer line blockages</li>
						<li>Floor drains and laundry drains</li>
					</ul>
					
					<h3>How We Clear Drains</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>Inspection to locate the blockage</li>
						<li>Cable (snake) or hydro-jetting as needed</li>
						<li>Camera inspection available for recurring issues</li>
						<li>Advice on preventing future clogs</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3>Avoid Chemical Drain Cleaners</h3>
					<p>Harsh chemical cleaners can damage pipes, harm the environment, and often fail to fully clear the clog. Professional mechanical cleaning is safer and more effective for most blockages.</p>
					
					<h3>Recurring Clogs?</h3>
					<p>If the same drain keeps clogging, there may be a deeper issue — tree roots, collapsed pipe, or improper slope. We can help diagnose the root cause and recommend a lasting solution.</p>
					
					<div class="mt-2">
						<a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Schedule Drain Cleaning</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="cta">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>Clogged Drain?</h2>
			<p>Call today for prompt drain cleaning service in Yucaipa.</p>
			<a href={`tel:${PHONE_TEL}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {PHONE}</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<Footer />
</body>
</html>
